# m=1 on a feature query opens no upload.
# References: ADR-1100 D14.
# spec: kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13), "Querying support for protocol features": "A feature query transmits no image data, any payload is ignored, and it has no effect on images or on any chunked transmission in progress."
# covers: image.kitty
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=q,i=52,e=T,U=1,m=1\e\\"
send "\e_Gm=0\e\\"
